        "original_id": "dfd782a9-e530-5742-8948-f085ec500336",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Picos de Europa National Park, Timanfaya National Park, Tobes, Lanzarote, Canary Islands, northern Spain\n- Organizations: Fforest Fawr Geopark\n- Concepts: National parks, geoparks\n\nFacts:\n- Picos de Europa National Park is a national park in the Picos de Europa mountain range in northern Spain.\n- Timanfaya National Park is a Spanish national park in the southwestern part of the island of Lanzarote in the Canary Islands.\n- Tobes is located in Picos de Europa National Park.\n- Fforest Fawr Geopark sits within a National Park, and its aims largely coincide with the statutory duties and purpose of that National Park.",
